    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:569e72e117968fcc",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "192c9da8837fa447337edf450cc7ebf8f32329128da8d3a3d42f0e6c8f02f132",
      "text": "After breakfast, a half-day guided excursion combining Sugar Loaf with a discovery of Rio’s historic centre. The first stop is Urca Hill, whose viewing area has restaurants and bars, before continuing to the summit of Sugar Loaf, with spectacular views of Copacabana Beach, Guanabara Bay, the surrounding mountains and islands, the Rio–Niterói Bridge and Christ the Redeemer on Corcovado. The tour then continues by car through the historic centre of Rio, before your guide takes you to lunch to enjoy local Brazilian cuisine.\n\nRecommended: for an exceptional lunch, Fogo de Chão, renowned for its Brazilian churrasco and its views of Sugar Loaf; in the evening, dinner at Al Mare, the seafood restaurant of the luxurious Fasano Hotel.\n\nIncluded: Sugar Loaf with VIP access and city tour with English-speaking guide · Breakfast",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "word_exact",
        "fileId": "1L1svAsQRNqNkd-O2liYEnhVhwBso6y6K",
